id: pm-rl-dpug
title: "Determinism receipts, and re-deriving them on demand"
description: "A Run records a receipt: seed policy, library versions, device, and the environment version. run verify re-derives it and reports the difference. An unreproducible run is then detectable at the moment it is claimed rather than months later when someone tries to build on it, which is the only time the information is cheap."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-31T06:38:32.554Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-01T12:08:34.237Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: A run whose receipt no longer re-derives is reported as unverifiable with the differing fields named; a matching receipt verifies; verify never mutates the run
